OL,3,AMeta strikes deal to stop Mark
OL,4,AZuckerberg leaving California over
OL,5,Abillionaire tax
OL,6,
OL,7,FMeta has agreed a deal with Mark
OL,8,FZuckerberg to stop the Facebook
OL,9,Fco-founder from leaving California
OL,10,Fafter he threatened to move from the
OL,11,Fstate because of a proposed tax on
OL,12,Fbillionaires.
OL,14,FThe agreement allows Zuckerberg -
OL,15,Freportedly one of the world's richest
OL,16,Fpeople - to sell shares in Meta without
OL,17,Flosing control of the Californian-based
OL,18,Fcompany if he needs to pay a large tax
OL,19,Fbill.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/19
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
