OL,3,AZoe Kleinman: PHP is the cyber
OL,4,Aequivalent of an unexploded bomb
OL,5,
OL,6,FI once worked opposite a site where a
OL,7,Fshopping centre was being built.
OL,9,FWe were warned there might be
OL,10,Funexploded bombs from World War Two
OL,11,Funearthed during the construction.
OL,13,FIn the end, there were none, but
OL,14,Fprocedures were put in place as a
OL,15,Fprecaution and we all had to practice
OL,16,Ffiling into designated safe zones
OL,17,Finside our building.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/19
