OL,3,ARussell Brand accuser said alleged rape
OL,4,A'really hurt', court hears
OL,5,
OL,6,FWarning - this report contains graphic
OL,7,Fcontent
OL,9,FThe friend of a woman claiming to have
OL,10,Fbeen raped by Russell Brand told a jury
OL,11,Fthe complainant had told her after the
OL,12,Falleged attack that it had "really,
OL,13,Freally hurt".
OL,15,FThe witness who spoke via video link at
OL,16,Fhis trial said she had attended the
OL,17,FHammersmith Apollo theatre in London
OL,18,Fwith the alleged victim in 2009, where
OL,19,Fthey had been invited to the
OL,20,Fdefendant's dressing room after his
OL,21,Fcomedy show.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/19
