OL,3,ADame Judi Dench: 'I can't do a play, a
OL,4,Afilm or read anymore'
OL,5,
OL,6,FShe also revealed how her condition can
OL,7,Flead to awkward encounters, saying she
OL,8,Fsometimes approaches the wrong people
OL,9,F"and give them an almost hug" before
OL,10,Frealising her mistake.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG15/19
